    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga hees asisiina giing'oonyangeagwa ng'asheega miyaasiin doobiiweadi, ak ghoanali gideaba eara agooga goondeawi Siida haw aba humng'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea eabeada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oopiidana muuchi jeeda mooshta ASEETA, nea ghoang'wearu aba ng'asheanji nea goobadiischeesi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoamwaschi ASEETA aba badahuukaasa, ak gootineasa ASEETA gidaghuuta aba ng'asheanda, ak geerukuti gidida funyaat bea Gristo ghayi siyiisean ghealoonigean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda ghaadaajiichi, aba gida eagasiidi rukunooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeawana weaghuumeeda aba madeeda fuga mamwasa, nea googadiyeati muuchi damanda sigooneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheegeagwa gagasa gwandeawa dagheerjeanduumeeda galeagasean, nea gwasamu balang'da, ak abeeda ghoanali gichea ashaayda ng'asheega buuneesean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighata huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiteanyu sean gaygwarukuneegwa Dikiko; niny orjeediyya aabwariinyi was siida gadiyeeda doabiiwaat, ak ea soomjeanda eandeawi bea Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea neajeagu niny heedeang'wa aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji, ak abeeda ghoanali gidasiwuurjeewi ea gideaba gaygoomajeek jeesingeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny gaygoodeana Onesmo, orjeediyya doabiiwaat aabwariinyi, nea niny gaba jeedeang'wa. Ak gaygwarukuneegwa ng'asheega sean sisin aba hiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaghadeegwa Aristarkoyda eandeayeesi ghealooniga sea Marko, was orjeeda hudagheamata Barnaba, (iitaanyi noanyaschi gideaba iihidu heedeang'wa ghoadeapchi), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuheeda siguura Yusto. Nea fiisu ea fuga ghasmeahooda gil aba jeeda fuga eandeayeesi gadiyeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA, ea niiw fuga geandeawanean salgheang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafraheeda was siida jeedeang'wa was soomjeanda Gristo Yesu, ghoaghadeagwa nea goopkeateegwa galeagasean nea gwasin badiida aba moashtaanyi bea ASEETA, ak ghoamiinaadi nea simwaseagwa aba haleanjeedida gasa ASEETEAN. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geawooschi muushoocheanda aba gideaba ghaadaayi gida deawiita aba badahuukeagwa ea giika mida Laodokiyean ea giika mida Hierapoliin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lukaheeda was meang'nyeanda biissa dabwariiyiin ea Dema ghoaghadeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada orjoogiyya mida Laodikiya ea gea mida Nimfa ea fuga ganiiseeda gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barawajeanji iisiisoamwa aba heedeang'wa, ghoanung' easoamwa eara aba Ganiisa mida Laodikiya, ama diita sing'oorsa Laodokiyahiin ghoasoami agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukusiina Arkipa, gideaba “Ng'ula muuchi gadiyeedida goonyi Ng'utamiidean sina nea giihiidi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giighadi ghaang'waarji aniini Bawlo aba geatindeanyu. Oapkaada gideaba siratean. Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
